"TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１.胃口：尚好但不吃太飽。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２.體力：自覺過去一週體力增強。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３.手腳：足溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４.小便： 夜尿仍有一、二次，一週來並無改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診： \n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： 同8/8方加巴戟天三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今日方如下："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豬苓三錢，滑石六錢，澤瀉六錢，白朮三錢，黃芩三錢，黃柏三錢，烏藥五錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細辛二錢，麥冬三錢，天花粉三錢，側柏葉三錢，當歸二錢，何首烏五錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海藻三錢，補骨脂三錢，巴戟天三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12 碗煮成 4 碗   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n已服豬苓湯以利下焦濕熱，但仍未利出來。原方已有補骨脂以強腎，今再加巴戟天進一步強腎，令夜尿減少。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}